    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/a519ff196f470c7844c0fabc003c1b5c.avif?t=1745228866\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hi, I'm KoKo. I'm the new order picker at AmaZoo.\u00a0</strong>My job is to get these boxes to the right place\u2014or at least, I <i>think</i> it is. I don\u2019t have all the instructions yet, and there are some dangerous things around here that I\u2019m not too sure about. <strong>Can you help me move all these boxes and find the way out?</strong> I really can\u2019t wait for this long day to be over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/2c0cefa7aeb52d39e30f5fa487a1c388.avif?t=1745228866\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/f53b4ee39862f3f2cc6a7c9bb245850b.poster.avif?t=1745228866\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/f53b4ee39862f3f2cc6a7c9bb245850b.webm?t=1745228866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/f53b4ee39862f3f2cc6a7c9bb245850b.mp4?t=1745228866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AmaZoo is a progressive and varied puzzle game inspired by the classic Sokoban, reimagined with a side-view perspective reminiscent of old-school 2D games.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an intuitive and engaging experience as you solve over 100 puzzles across multiple stages, each carefully crafted to challenge your logical thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to <strong>move and organize various types of boxes to clear the way to the exit and advance to the next stage</strong>. But beware\u2014some boxes have unexpected behaviors, and one wrong move can quickly turn a simple task into a tricky challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/4953303fa96eeeb69407f428995afafd.avif?t=1745228866\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/bf5c3df411d6f370d944fb31acd9157c.avif?t=1745228866\" width=616 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are several types of \u2018boxes\u2019 in the game, each with unique characteristics and mechanisms. As KoKo, you\u2019ll need to use your skills to <strong>carry, drop, throw, stack, jump, and climb with the boxes in hand</strong>. And if one gets in your way or drives you crazy, <strong>don\u2019t hesitate to kick it out of your path!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/bf352a69b1a3fd1cf6dd4691408b2215.avif?t=1745228866\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AmaZoo\u2019s warehouses are anything but safe</strong>\u2014definitely not up to humanoid safety standards. You\u2019ll encounter towering staircases, compactors, faulty machinery, spikes, lasers, and even explosive hazards. <strong>Be careful, KoKo\u2014workplace accidents are just around the corner!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/fbc17d4198341a7d636657eb5ffe144b.avif?t=1745228866\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t let the calm atmosphere fool you\u2014<strong>progression brings increasingly challenging puzzles designed to push your logic and creativity to the limit.</strong> Will you rise to the occasion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy a challenge, you can replay levels to beat your own record! <strong>But remember: optimizing your work is key.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/a519ff196f470c7844c0fabc003c1b5c.avif?t=1745228866\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hi, I'm KoKo. I'm the new order picker at AmaZoo.\u00a0</strong>My job is to get these boxes to the right place\u2014or at least, I <i>think</i> it is. I don\u2019t have all the instructions yet, and there are some dangerous things around here that I\u2019m not too sure about. <strong>Can you help me move all these boxes and find the way out?</strong> I really can\u2019t wait for this long day to be over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/2c0cefa7aeb52d39e30f5fa487a1c388.avif?t=1745228866\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/f53b4ee39862f3f2cc6a7c9bb245850b.poster.avif?t=1745228866\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/f53b4ee39862f3f2cc6a7c9bb245850b.webm?t=1745228866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/f53b4ee39862f3f2cc6a7c9bb245850b.mp4?t=1745228866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AmaZoo is a progressive and varied puzzle game inspired by the classic Sokoban, reimagined with a side-view perspective reminiscent of old-school 2D games.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an intuitive and engaging experience as you solve over 100 puzzles across multiple stages, each carefully crafted to challenge your logical thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to <strong>move and organize various types of boxes to clear the way to the exit and advance to the next stage</strong>. But beware\u2014some boxes have unexpected behaviors, and one wrong move can quickly turn a simple task into a tricky challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/4953303fa96eeeb69407f428995afafd.avif?t=1745228866\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/bf5c3df411d6f370d944fb31acd9157c.avif?t=1745228866\" width=616 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are several types of \u2018boxes\u2019 in the game, each with unique characteristics and mechanisms. As KoKo, you\u2019ll need to use your skills to <strong>carry, drop, throw, stack, jump, and climb with the boxes in hand</strong>. And if one gets in your way or drives you crazy, <strong>don\u2019t hesitate to kick it out of your path!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/bf352a69b1a3fd1cf6dd4691408b2215.avif?t=1745228866\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AmaZoo\u2019s warehouses are anything but safe</strong>\u2014definitely not up to humanoid safety standards. You\u2019ll encounter towering staircases, compactors, faulty machinery, spikes, lasers, and even explosive hazards. <strong>Be careful, KoKo\u2014workplace accidents are just around the corner!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/fbc17d4198341a7d636657eb5ffe144b.avif?t=1745228866\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t let the calm atmosphere fool you\u2014<strong>progression brings increasingly challenging puzzles designed to push your logic and creativity to the limit.</strong> Will you rise to the occasion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy a challenge, you can replay levels to beat your own record! <strong>But remember: optimizing your work is key.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Help KoKo on his first day at work! Push, kick, grab and rearrange the boxes, while avoiding the dangers throughout the mega-warehouse. Solve all the puzzles and finally reach the exit!",
